---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Frequently asked questions" description="Answers about Homi applications and activation.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Help centre</span><h1>Frequently asked questions</h1></div></section>
  <section class="content"><div class="container content-narrow">
    <details open><summary>Do I need a customer account to activate the app?</summary><p>No. Activation does not require a customer account, password, or email address.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Does Homi Grocery work offline?</summary><p>The application works locally. Signed license verification can also work offline within the validity and access policy embedded in the license.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How do I receive a license?</summary><p>After the request is reviewed and payment receipt is confirmed for paid plans, the team provides a license file bound to the approved device.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Does a lifetime license include every future update?</summary><p>A lifetime license covers the purchased application version. Future updates and support are separate services.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Is store sales data uploaded to the platform?</summary><p>No. Activation does not require uploading sales, inventory, customer balances, or the local store database.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How can I contact support?</summary><p><a href="tel:+2490904697455">+249 090 469 7455</a></p></details>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
